<title>SPAIN: Iberdrola H1 electricity demand rose 1.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Iberdrola H1 electricity demand rose 1.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish utility Iberdrola said demand from its customers for electricity rose 1.9 percent in the first six months of the year to 30.12 billion kilowatts/hour.</p>
<p>Total net production at Iberdrola through June 30, once internal generation demands were subtracted, reached 23.22 billion Kwh, the note added.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
